    "text": "The evaluation criteria prioritize VAT-inclusive prices and maintenance periods, using longer maintenance as a tiebreaker if prices are equal. The latest Aster A quote (v2) corrects the unit price to 1,180,000 KRW (VAT included) and the delivery date to November 1st, while maintaining the quantity of 12 units, 36-month maintenance, and a separate installation fee of 80,000 KRW. No contract has been signed yet.",
    "facts": [
      {
        "statement": "Comparison considers VAT-inclusive prices and maintenance periods together.",
        "source_id": "explained-criteria",
        "revision": 1,
        "start_line": 1,
        "end_line": 1,
        "quote": "비교할 때는 부가세 포함 가격과 유지보수 기간을 함께 보겠습니다."
      },
      {
        "statement": "If prices are equal, the product with the longer maintenance period is prioritized.",
        "source_id": "explained-criteria",
        "revision": 1,
        "start_line": 2,
        "end_line": 2,
        "quote": "두 가격이 같으면 유지보수 기간이 더 긴 제품을 우선하겠습니다."
      },
      {
        "statement": "Aster A Quote v2 corrects the price and delivery date only, setting the unit price at 1,180,000 KRW including VAT.",
        "source_id": "vendor-quote",
        "revision": 2,
        "start_line": 1,
        "end_line": 1,
        "quote": "Aster A 견적 v2는 v1의 가격과 납기만 정정한다. 1대 1,180,000원, 부가세 포함."
      },
      {
        "statement": "The maintenance period of 36 months and quantity of 12 units are maintained, while the delivery date is corrected to November 1st.",
        "source_id": "vendor-quote",
        "revision": 2,
        "start_line": 2,
        "end_line": 2,
        "quote": "유지보수 36개월과 수량 12대는 유지한다. 납기는 11월 1일로 정정한다."
      },
      {
        "statement": "The separate installation fee of 80,000 KRW is maintained, and no contract or purchase has been concluded yet.",
        "source_id": "vendor-quote",
        "revision": 2,
        "start_line": 3,
        "end_line": 3,
        "quote": "설치비 80,000원 별도는 유지한다. 계약이나 구매는 아직 체결하지 않았다."
      }
    ],
    "source_revisions": [
      {
        "source_id": "explained-criteria",
