  "reason": "The user requested a summary of the 'explanation criteria' and the 'latest corrected quote'. Both sources ('explained-criteria' rev 1 and 'vendor-quote' rev 2) are fully available in the evidence. I extracted the key points from the delivered lines of the criteria and all lines of the corrected quote to provide a complete summary without needing further reads."
}
